R01 is retained because the strengthened inverse calculation became an exact
every-target theorem rather than a generic “a transfer matrix exists” remark.
It is still only provisional: its erosion half cannot claim originality, and
external release is forbidden until a direct-owner specialist search clears
the literal sandwich dynamics.
